#: ../../openmvcam/tutorial/production/firmware/simulation.rst:127
msgid ""
"``run.py`` discovers and executes every test, printing a ``PASSED`` / "
"``FAILED`` line per test with timing and a summary at the end."
msgstr ""
"``run.py`` 会发现并执行每一个测试，为每个测试打印一行带计时的 ``PASSED`` / ``FAILED``\\ ，并在末尾给出汇总。"

